{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03147","headline":"经江宁览旧迹至玄武湖 · 张九龄","name":"经江宁览旧迹至玄武湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国更数世，北湖方十洲。\n天清华林苑，日晏景阳楼。\n果下回仙骑，津傍驻彩斿。\n凫鷖喧凤管，荷芰鬬龙舟。\n七子陪诗赋，千人和棹讴。\n应言在镐乐，不让横汾秋。\n风俗因纾慢，江山成易由。\n驹王信不武，孙叔是无谋。\n佳气日将歇，霸功谁与修。\n桑田东海变，麋鹿姑苏游。\n否运争三国，康时劣九州。\n山虽幕府在，馆岂豫章留。\n水淀还相阅，菱歌亦故遒。\n雄图不足问，唯想事风流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}